chapter.v:
I spread 


out my, 


hands all the day to a rebellious people, who walk in a way that is not good, following their own devices;

a people 


who provoke, 


me to my face continually, sacrificing in gardens and making offerings on bricks;

who sit 


in tombs,, 


and spend the night in secret places; who eat pig’s flesh, and broth of tainted meat is in their vessels;

Therefore thus 


says the, 


Lord GOD: “Behold, my servants shall eat, but you shall be hungry; behold, my servants shall drink, but you shall be thirsty; behold, my servants shall rejoice, but you shall be put to shame;
